```css
body {
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    background-color: #f2f2f2;
}

header {
    background-color: #222;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
}

nav {
    background-color: #444;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 12px;
}

nav a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin: 15px;
}

section {
    background-color: white;
    margin: 20px auto;
    padding: 20px;
    width: 80%;
    border-radius: 8px;
}

h2 {
    color: #333;
}

form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 400px;
}

label {
    margin-top: 10px;
}

input, select {
    padding: 10px;
    margin-top: 5px;
}

button {
    margin-top: 15px;
    padding: 10px;
    background-color: #333;
    color: white;
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
}

button:hover {
    background-color: #555;
}

table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
}

th, td {
    border: 1px solid #999;
    padding: 10px;
    text-align: center;
}

th {
    background-color: #ddd;
}

footer {
    background-color: #222;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 15px;
}

@media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
    section {
        width: 90%;
    }

    form {
        width: 100%;
    }

    nav a {
        display: block;
        margin: 8px;
    }
}
```
